effect of stimulus type overall, among 6 (Social - Non-social) and among 12-mos (Social - Non-social); p-values: 

```{r vpc-model-analysis}
mod <-lmerTest::lmer(
    formula = target_prop ~ Age*Stimulus_type + (1 | response_uuid) + (1 | `Trial Total`),
    data = vpc_enrollment$metrics %>% dplyr::rename(Stimulus_type = "Stimulus type"),
    REML = TRUE
  )
emmeans(mod, pairwise ~ Stimulus_type)$contrasts

emmeans(mod, pairwise ~ Stimulus_type | Age)$contrasts
```

